    "name": "Cobalt System",
    "steam_appid": 3200030,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3200030/extras/8562018398caf37db31aaadbffb0e31c.poster.avif?t=1737809588\" width=608 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3200030/extras/8562018398caf37db31aaadbffb0e31c.webm?t=1737809588\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3200030/extras/8562018398caf37db31aaadbffb0e31c.mp4?t=1737809588\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cobalt System is a first-person shooter game that allows you to immerse yourself in the atmosphere of ancient Mars. Playing as a guardian of an abandoned temple complex, fight your way through many obstacles and enemies of different types in order to obtain a lost relic that can change the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore levels and find secret locations as well as various ancient artifacts that will give more understanding about the Martian civilization, which is on the verge of collapse.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3200030/extras/8562018398caf37db31aaadbffb0e31c.poster.avif?t=1737809588\" width=608 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3200030/extras/8562018398caf37db31aaadbffb0e31c.webm?t=1737809588\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3200030/extras/8562018398caf37db31aaadbffb0e31c.mp4?t=1737809588\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cobalt System is a first-person shooter game that allows you to immerse yourself in the atmosphere of ancient Mars. Playing as a guardian of an abandoned temple complex, fight your way through many obstacles and enemies of different types in order to obtain a lost relic that can change the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore levels and find secret locations as well as various ancient artifacts that will give more understanding about the Martian civilization, which is on the verge of collapse.</p>",
    "short_description": "Cobalt System is an atmospheric sci-fi first-person shooter that places you into the heart of the conflict unfolding on ancient Mars.",
